("S1","and one of its runs has a registered course with no bound on its states.","and one of its runs has a course through the map with no bound on its states."),
("L-extrap","@laws/7/zh","运行只在 T 步之前分开、此后不分开时，经映射的值可判定，从一个运行在 T 所在处出发没有两个运行分开；被 N 个配置所持时其历程至多 T + N 个状态，按最小的界的外推从 2(T + N) − 1 起每步都对。"),
("L-extrap","@laws/7/en","Where runs part only before step T and never after, the values through the map decided, no two runs part from where a run is at T; held by N configurations its course has at most T + N states, and the extrapolation by the least bound is right from 2(T + N) − 1 on."),
("L-built","@laws/9/zh","反方向：步与经映射的值可判定时，依过程所建的外推从前段读出运行可能所在的配置，取第一个由之可走下去者，提出它经映射的值；它在某步于从一个配置出发的每个运行上都对，恰当没有两个这样的运行在该步分开；所以某个外推在那里对，恰当没有运行在那里分开。"),
("L-built","@laws/9/en","The converse: with decided steps and values through the map, the extrapolation built from the process reads from the prefix the configurations a run can be at, takes the first from which a run goes on, and proposes its value through the map; it is right at a step on every run from a configuration exactly where no two of those runs part there, so some extrapolation is right there exactly where none part."),
